            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.22.1+JOS.22.2+JOS.22.3+JOS.22.4+JOS.22.5+JOS.22.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yosh. 22.1-6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Yoshua aboolela chikholo cha Rubeni ne Kati nende balala khu be ekholo eya Manase ali, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Khebulila likhuwa nilio Musa, omukholi owa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi amulaka ali, Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wenywe akhamuelesie sibala sino lubeka lwe ebukwe owa Yoritani khuba sisienywe mumenyemo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakhasi benywe, babaana benywe, bacha khurama ano ne chikhaafu. Ne banamae benywe, bakangile bulwaani bwe liie, bacha khunyoa khukhwambukha ebweeni we Baisiraeli basiaabwe nio babayeete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulikhola murio nabwila banyoola kamaloba mumbo mwa Yoritani niko Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wenywe abaelesia. Chikholo che Baisiraeli choosi ne chimalile khunyoola kumuleembe ne kamaloba kabwe munyala mwakobola mala mwamenya mu maloba kenywe ebukwe owa Yoritani, sibala nisio Musa, omukholi owa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi abaelesia.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakobosia Yoshua bali, “khucha khukhola buli sisiindu nisio okhubooleele ne khucha oosi oosi niio okhuruma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khucha khukhuria nga ne khwarichanga Musa. Nono Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wowo akhoya abe ne nawe nga aba ne Musa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesi yesi olekelesia bunyali bwowo namwe alekhe khuria lilala khu malaka kowo, acha khwirwa. Ba ne kamaani ne bunyindaafu!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
